:: Ev_my_story_meet
<<view "event-media">>
<h1>Someone needs a hand</h1>

A woman is struggling with a stack of boxes outside the charity shop.
<<when { stat: { id: "energy", max: 30 } }>>
You're exhausted, but she looks desperate.
<<otherwise>>
She catches your eye hopefully.
<</when>>

"Any chance you could help out for a bit, <<name>>? I'm here most days."

<<choice "Say yes" "Ev_my_story_yes" { effects: [{ storyline: { id: "my_story", to: "helping" } }] }>>
<<choice "Not now" { effects: [{ stat: { mood: -1 } }] }>>

:: Ev_my_story_yes
<<view "event-media">>
"Brilliant!" She hands you a box before you can change your mind. "Come back whenever you're passing."

<<view "event-end">>

:: Ev_my_story_done
<<view "event-media">>
<h1>Thank you</h1>

"I couldn't have done it without you," she says, and means it.

<<view "event-end">>
